Pursuant to Regulations 30 and 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 ("Listing Regulations"), we hereby inform the Stock Exchange that the Board of Directors of the Company in their meeting held on Friday, November 13, 2026, at the Registered Office of the Company situated at Plot No. D-73/1, Additional MIDC, Latur-413512, Maharashtra, India, have inter-alia, has transacted the following main business:
1) Considered and approved the Unaudited Standalone Financial Results for the Half Year ended September 30, 2026, along with the Statement of Assets and Liabilities and Cash Flow Statement for the Half Year ended September 30, 2026;
2) Approved the appointment of Mrs. Krupa Mayankkumar Gandhi (Membership No. A82371) as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from November 13, 2026.
